cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the versioned Zenodo record associated with the release."
title: "Analytical Oblique Cutting: Quartic Reduction and Interactive 3D Explorer"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ganji
    given-names: Morteza
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-3601-4308"
version: "0.1.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ganjimorteza/Altintas_Analytical_Oblique_Cutting_3D_Explorer"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible computational demonstration of an algebraic quartic reduction
  of the five-angle maximum-shear-stress oblique-cutting system in Section 2.5
  of Altintas (2012), together with explicit cutting-force expressions,
  numerical consistency checks, and an offline interactive 3D visualization.
  This software does not claim independent physical validation or literature priority.
keywords:
  - oblique cutting
  - machining mechanics
  - chip-flow angle
  - cutting forces
  - analytic reduction
  - three-dimensional visualization
